8. Refresh procedure
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Regenerate after any dependency change that moves pubspec.lock:

    python3 tool/gen-notices.py --write

The generator reads pubspec.lock, resolves each hosted package's license
from the local pub cache, classifies it by matching the license text, and
fails on any package it cannot classify or cannot find. A package that
reaches UNKNOWN must be resolved by hand before release — it is a legal
question, not a formatting one.

